  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fd0c92282cf7ebd9a25734f7d7bdcdd2b1c1592d17097f7aadb5309292a1b17",
      "text": "出演动物系综艺节目的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a4fa07901e16fbae4c1ba5be56e55fa7edfe3c81b819694c2e68ce2d44ac25b",
      "text": "今天是动物节目的训狗企划录制吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8a8ab7e5f6854e527f6cbb14be2d061ec8bacc9d35b4a1aa3f1bffb757d5732",
      "text": "而且，今天要做训练的是大型犬。\n虽然节目人员有些担心我，但完全不要紧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fde3cb7ebd1647948fb73c7ceb5d889453163660364c8389ad55dba2618eda3",
      "text": "说起来，丽先生家里也养了大型犬呢。\n我想想，记得是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:801caa7255ed65a9265498412a4d458444771ee4238d2fbd5bcc93cf3fcdf268",
      "text": "养了一只叫中提琴的金毛寻回犬。\n是个聪明又温柔的孩子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98823aabf251c1f1bd052fabb9bd9ba0f7763368de9adb771bc025063e872547",
      "text": "节目组准备的狗狗\n好像也是金毛寻回犬呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b2e4e15bc32876f3d9eb70bc4495cb97637b20056eb11d6459781ffa4e01e5d",
      "text": "丽先生看起来很高兴呢。因为自己养了狗，\n所以很期待和小动物接触吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:657c7ee24ec419dfa3f92c5668abae6fcf486ae3990acf24e50e18dac51a1c9b",
      "text": "嗯，很期待。\n因为我很喜欢和狗狗接触。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29431ff04908799cca9b8f2e88360ae9e84358efec32ceb206d4024cc6fa40a7",
      "text": "当然，我家的狗狗才是第一位的。\n毕竟是我最重要的家人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_04:1_5_008_04:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e64047dbfe0d8f4738f63163b7d96cd001333c3c75615c0f4e40525c820feb1a",
      "text": "聊得有些起劲了啊。时间差不多了。\n那么，我进去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
